<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="692566"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1500895733"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Asphodelus"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ceui"/><amll:meta key="album" value="穢翼のユースティア ORIGINAL SOUND TRACK"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:50.439"><div begin="00:32.225" end="04:50.439"><p begin="00:32.225" end="00:36.769" itunes:key="L1">囚われた絶望の淵で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你被囚禁在绝望的深渊时 请抱紧我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tola wa re ta zecu bou no fuqi de wa ta xi wo da ki xi me te ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="00:36.770" end="00:41.187" itunes:key="L2">わたしを抱きしめてください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望你能将我紧紧拥抱</span></p><p begin="00:41.188" end="00:45.528" itunes:key="L3">静寂に埋め尽くされ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深埋在寂静的夜 一个人瑟瑟发抖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sei jiaku ni wu me cu ku sa re hito li de kogo e te lu</span></p><p begin="00:45.529" end="00:50.281" itunes:key="L4">一人で凍えてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在冷寂中独自一人宛若冰雕</span></p><p begin="00:50.282" end="00:54.540" itunes:key="L5">崩れ堕ちてゆく楽園の果てで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在崩落的乐园边缘 回响着被遗忘的祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kuzu re o qi te yu ku laku en no ha te de wasu re la re ta ino li ga hibi i te lu</span></p><p begin="00:54.541" end="00:59.176" itunes:key="L6">忘れられた祈りが響いてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远回响着那已被忘却的祷词</span></p><p begin="00:59.177" end="01:09.626" itunes:key="L7">支配する闇の中でも涸れない愛よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使在被统治的黑暗中未枯竭的爱 觉醒 永久的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi hai su lu yami no naka de mo ka re na i ai yo me za me yo to wa ni</span></p><p begin="01:09.627" end="01:14.171" itunes:key="L8">目覚めよ 永久に</p><p begin="01:14.172" end="01:17.814" itunes:key="L9">無限に降る孤独を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用那手指把无限的孤独染上爱的颜色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu gen ni fu lu ko doku wo so no yubi de so me te ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="01:17.815" end="01:22.016" itunes:key="L10">その指で染めてください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沾染我深邃莫及的孤独吧</span></p><p begin="01:22.017" end="01:27.019" itunes:key="L11">叫ぶこの心が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐喊的心 像爱上了这份悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sake bu ko no kokolo ga kana xi mi wo ai se lu yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:27.020" end="01:33.486" itunes:key="L12">悲しみを愛せるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能够包容那份悲伤</span></p><p begin="01:33.487" end="02:01.278" itunes:key="L13">まだ見ぬあの光の景色へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去见那还没见过的光的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu a no hikali no ke xiki he</span></p><p begin="02:01.279" end="02:05.310" itunes:key="L14">乱れ咲く花より深く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比绽放的花还温柔的吻我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mida re sa ku hana yo li fuka ku yasa xi ku kuqi zu ke te ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="02:05.311" end="02:10.293" itunes:key="L15">優しく口づけてください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何不赐我以深情一吻</span></p><p begin="02:10.294" end="02:19.109" itunes:key="L16">躊躇いの吐息さえも 命を灯してく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连犹豫的呼吸 也点亮了生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tame la i no to iki sa e mo inoqi wo tomo xi te ku</span></p><p begin="02:19.110" end="02:23.505" itunes:key="L17">滲む幻に 祝宴の鐘を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给这幻想送以钟声　将这温柔用肌肤传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">niji mu maboloxi ni xiyuku en no kane wo so no nuku mo li su hada ni cuta wu ma de</span></p><p begin="02:23.506" end="02:28.286" itunes:key="L18">その温もり素肌に伝うまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如阵阵暖流游曳在每一寸肌肤</span></p><p begin="02:28.287" end="02:37.222" itunes:key="L19">迸る嵐の中も止まない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在狂风暴雨中都不停歇 爱 苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hotobaxi lu alaxi no naka mo ya ma na i ai yo me za me yo</span></p><p begin="02:37.223" end="02:41.922" itunes:key="L20">愛よ目覚めよ</p><p begin="02:41.923" end="02:47.843" itunes:key="L21">抗えぬ願いを その瞳（め）で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用那眼眸去迎接那无法抗拒的愿望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">alaga e nu nega i wo so no me de muka e te ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="02:47.844" end="02:50.299" itunes:key="L22">迎えてください</p><p begin="02:50.300" end="03:01.026" itunes:key="L23">出逢えた喜びに 震えてる裸の心で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用颤抖的心灵去迎接那相逢的喜悦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de a e ta yoloko bi ni fulu e te lu hadaka no kokolo de</span></p><p begin="03:01.027" end="03:35.881" itunes:key="L24">求める あの残酷の彼方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去追寻 向那残酷的彼案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">moto me lu a no zan koku no ka nata he</span></p><p begin="03:35.882" end="03:39.687" itunes:key="L25">零れ散る涙が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">散落的眼泪随风飘舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kobo re qi lu namida ga ki la ki la to kaze ni ma wu kolo</span></p><p begin="03:39.688" end="03:44.203" itunes:key="L26">きらきらと風に舞う頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随风的舞步画出闪烁光晕</span></p><p begin="03:44.204" end="03:50.136" itunes:key="L27">絆を痛みをください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给我永不消失的牵绊和痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kizuna wo ita mi wo ku da sa i ei en ni ki e na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:50.137" end="03:55.681" itunes:key="L28">永遠に消えないように</p><p begin="03:55.682" end="04:00.083" itunes:key="L29">無限に降る孤独を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把无限涌出的孤独都给我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu gen ni fu lu ko doku wo wa ta xi ni azu ke te ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="04:00.084" end="04:04.413" itunes:key="L30">わたしに預けてください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你深邃的孤独送给我吧</span></p><p begin="04:04.414" end="04:15.293" itunes:key="L31">喚び合えた心が 扉を放ち羽ばたく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">互相互换的心灵 放飞翅膀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo bi a e ta kokolo ga tobila wo hana qi ha ba ta ku</span></p><p begin="04:15.294" end="04:19.942" itunes:key="L32">近づく あの始まりの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去靠近 那所有源泉的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">qika zu ku a no haji ma li no so la he</span></p><p begin="04:19.943" end="04:50.439" itunes:key="L33">天空（そら）へ</p></div></body></tt>